[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17827.03, "timestamp": "04:57:07", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17829.75, "timestamp": "04:57:09", "text": "好了，我们准备出发了吗？哦不，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17832.31, "timestamp": "04:57:12", "text": "还需要制作另一套盔甲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17836.07, "timestamp": "04:57:16", "text": "其他套装盔甲或者类似光泽盔甲之类的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17838.39, "timestamp": "04:57:18", "text": "纤维编织的卧式冷冻柜。我们需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17844.39, "timestamp": "04:57:24", "text": "所以，我的基本修补工具包，它都包含哪些东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17847.75, "timestamp": "04:57:27", "text": "做？哦，那就像你看到手工制作一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17849.43, "timestamp": "04:57:29", "text": "桌子？它就像手工材料一样，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17852.55, "timestamp": "04:57:32", "text": "修理东西。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17860.948, "timestamp": "04:57:40", "text": "那。你有什么吗？嗯，我想是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17864.15, "timestamp": "04:57:44", "text": "可能就在这里。是啊，告诉我那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17867.75, "timestamp": "04:57:47", "text": "纤维制品。纤维。就是那根细绳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17870.27, "timestamp": "04:57:50", "text": "是的。哦，是的。等等，让我拿一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17873.43, "timestamp": "04:57:53", "text": "他们。我有16个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17877.51, "timestamp": "04:57:57", "text": "等等，它看起来像个锤子。"}]